        "generetiLivecodeLastGood": {
          "mode": "markdown",
          "source": "# Ink and light\n\nA local creative stage inside **ComfyUI**.\n\nFeedback retains the previous texture:\n\n$$C_t = S_t + (1-\\alpha_t)\\,d\\,T(C_{t-1})$$\n\n- $S_t$: live source\n- $d$: feedback decay\n- $T$: scale, rotation and translation\n\nChange this document, then press Cmd/Ctrl+Enter.\n\nTry HTML, LaTeX, SVG, Three, Playcore or Manim in the language dropdown."
